de inc\"><div class=\"nl\">P11</div>x<sub>1</sub> = 0<br>x<sub>2</sub> = 4<br>Z = 28<div class=\"tg\">Entera → incumbente</div></div></li><li><div class=\"br\">x<sub>1</sub> ≥ 1</div><div class=\"node ram\"><div class=\"nl\">P12</div>x<sub>1</sub> = 1<br>x<sub>2</sub> = 3,6<br>Z = 29,2<div class=\"tg\">Ramificar</div></div><ul><li><div class=\"br\">x<sub>2</sub> ≤ 3</div><div class=\"node pod\"><div class=\"nl\">P121</div>x<sub>1</sub> = 1,5<br>x<sub>2</sub> = 3<br>Z = 27<div class=\"tg\">Poda por cota</div><div class=\"nn\">Z = 27 ≤ incumbente 28</div></div></li><li><div class=\"br\">x<sub>2</sub> ≥ 4</div><div class=\"node nf\"><div class=\"nl\">P122</div><b>Infactible</b><div class=\"tg\">Poda: infactible</div></div></li></ul></li></ul></li><li><div class=\"br\">x<sub>2</sub> ≥ 5</div><div class=\"node nf\"><div class=\"nl\">P2</div><b>Infactible</b><div class=\"tg\">Poda: infactible</div></div></li></ul></li></ul></div><p><b>Óptimo entero:</b> x<sub>1</sub> = 0, x<sub>2</sub> = 4, Z = <b>28</b> (nodo P11). Gap = 33,6 − 28 = 5,6.</p></div>"}]}